#: ../../index.rst:5
msgid "Welcome to the Krita |version| Manual!"
msgstr "Dobrodošli v Priročnika za Krito |version|!"

#: ../../index.rst:7
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Krita is a sketching and painting program designed for digital artists. Our "
"vision for Development of Krita is —"
msgstr ""
"Krita je program za skiciranje in slikanje, namenjen digitalnim umetnikom. "
"Naša vizija za razvoj Krite je —"

#: ../../index.rst:9
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Krita is a free and open source cross-platform application that offers an "
"end-to-end solution for creating digital art files from scratch. Krita is "
"optimized for frequent, prolonged and focused use. Explicitly supported "
"fields of painting are illustrations, concept art, matte painting, textures, "
"comics and animations. Developed together with users, Krita is an "
"application that supports their actual needs and workflow. Krita supports "
"open standards and interoperates with other applications."
msgstr ""
"Krita je brezplačna in odprtokodna aplikacija navzkrižne platforme, ki "
"ponuja končno rešitev za ustvarjanje digitalnih umetniških datotek iz nič. "
"Krita je optimizirana za pogosto, dolgotrajno in usmerjeno uporabo. Izrecno "
"podprta področja slikanja so ilustracije, konceptna umetnost, mat "
"slikarstvo, teksture, stripi in animacije. Razvita skupaj z uporabniki, "
"Krita je aplikacija, ki podpira njihove dejanske potrebe in potek dela. "
"Krita podpira odprte standarde in interoperira z drugimi aplikacijami."

#: ../../index.rst:17
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Krita's tools are developed keeping the above vision in mind. Although it "
"has features that overlap with other raster editors its intended purpose is "
"to provide robust tool for digital painting and creating artworks from "
"scratch. As you learn about Krita, keep in mind that it is not intended as a "
"replacement for Photoshop. This means that the other programs may have more "
"features than Krita for image manipulation tasks, such as stitching together "
"photos, while Krita's tools are most relevant to digital painting, concept "
"art, illustration, and texturing. This fact accounts for a great deal of "
"Krita's design."
msgstr ""
"Kritina orodja so razvita obdrži zgornji vid v mislih. Čeprav ima funkcije, "
"ki se prekrivajo z drugimi raster uredniki njegov namen je zagotoviti "
"robustno orodje za digitalno slikarstvo in ustvarjanje umetniških del iz "
"nič. Kot boste izvedeli o Kriti, imajte v mislih, da ni namenjen kot "
"zamenjava za Photoshop. To pomeni, da imajo drugi programi morda več funkcij "
"kot Krita za opravila za manipulacijo slik, kot so šivanje fotografij, "
"medtem ko so Kritina orodja najbolj pomembna za digitalno slikanje, "
"konceptno umetnost, ilustracijo in teksturo. To dejstvo pomeni veliko "
"Kritinega oblikovanja."

